{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Why'd you need him?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:19:02.954000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868633408245473302","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Well, he speaks for the dead, right?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:19:18.856000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868633474943303701","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"What if he could contact the ravens?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:19:56.650000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868633633462833223","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"He hasn't shared all the details about— Willow, that's brilliant!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:20:15.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868633712382849064","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Oh, and we'll need to discuss the grove with Nolan and Apgan.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:20:59.575000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868633897389391972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I'm leaning toward summoning the greedy and ravenous one, to open the way to Nifehl.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:21:58.468000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868634144404553758","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"We could bring the ravens back.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:22:09.714000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868634191573696533","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Come inside, let's talk here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:22:38.609000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868634312768094229","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
