{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"They settle on a simple dining table in the middle of a room.","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:23:20.167000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868634487074996244","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I, I had been thinking about it. What we could do with the spear.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:24:04.156000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868634671578222662","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Uh, before we start. Finn said he wanted to be 'just friends' and I felt terrible after. Then... I heard a howl...\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:25:43.704000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868635089112813648","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Something called to me...\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:26:15.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868635223854825474","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Irynx's eyes go wide. \"Finn's okay now? Who brought him back?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:27:08.092000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868635443061719071","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"The Mender.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:27:16.367000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868635477769584640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Mender's a nice guy. I'm glad.\" She nods.","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:29:01.943000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868635920587448401","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"When I heard the howl... I felt something... full of greed.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:30:01.305000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868636169569730590","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
