{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Something else... something similar, but something else.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:32:08.678000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868636703810793513","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Preying on you now that we don't have the ravens anymore.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:34:00.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868637171190480997","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:34:16.320000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868637239180132352","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"What were you thinking of doing with the spear?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:34:29.960000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868637296390447144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Hold on to it? I was going to wait for what you'd decide but I did want to bring the ravens back. But I also want us to be prepared, as best as we can.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:36:52.896000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868637895907508224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"As well as try to have Speaker talk to them. The more information we can learn about this, the better.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:37:11.921000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868637975704113232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"What if... the ravens don't want to come back?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:37:50.673000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868638138241777734","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"You heard the green man. They left before their time! They'll have to come back.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:38:23.642000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868638276523806740","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"(lol i just had the random thought that at a certain level, the both of us will be able to shift into ravens)","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:40:32.337000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868638816309747802","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"(8th level for me)","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:41:29.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868639054432968706","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"(level 6. close enough)","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:41:50.427000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868639143842951268","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Do you mind if I sleep here tonight? Unless, you're planning on sleeping somewhere else. Its probably best if we stick together, you know? 2 ravens, not one?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:44:03.954000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868639703895801866","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Yeah, sure. You probably aren't feeling up to staying on the Golden Voice after everything.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:45:31.645000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868640071698513970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Finn needs time to rest. I don't want to bother him.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:46:10.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868640233778995210","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"And you? What are your feelings?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:46:55.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868640421557981214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I don't know how to feel... I'm sad but, hopeful... that eventually, we can be together again... but I'll end up outliving him... and then we'll be apart again...\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:48:26.747000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868640806129524778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Irynx squints. \"You're looking too far ahead. I'm not much for romance, really, but I think friends is good. In the meantime, you can stay here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:50:08.541000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868641233084489728","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Thank you. He said I shouldn't be afraid to lose him, but... I just can't help it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:50:52.167000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868641416065191937","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Hey, take it from someone who's lived too long. I've made so many friends and I've outlived them all. The truth is, you gain so much more than you lose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:52:26.030000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868641809755148328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"You won't outlive me, friend. We're both elves!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:53:14.324000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868642012314890311","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"She plays with a braid. \"About that...\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:53:43.804000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868642135962943498","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"What?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:54:29.897000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868642329291026462","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"When Gaillardia brought me back, you know there's a price. And we always get to negotiate for what we want to lose. It's just... I've lived so long already, way past overdue. I gave away some of my years.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:55:51.651000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868642672192155648","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"How many?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:57:23.590000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868643057812275261","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"It's no amount I haven't already lived. A century is almost nothing to an elf, especially one that's had more than our usual share of centuries.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:58:00.536000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868643212775022613","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"But... we don't live forever... you'll die some day.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T23:58:30.872000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868643340013436948","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
