{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"She holds Willow's cheek. \"Listen. I'm finally someone I'd like to die as. That's a good thing. But I have no intention of biting it earlier than when I'm 1500 years old and in a bed.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:00:19.303000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868643794805985301","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
