{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"bones hand climbs up willow and tries to give a comforting pat on the shoulder","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:01:07.339000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868643996283572285","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I felt you kiss my forehead last night... why?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:02:40.820000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868644388371316766","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"I had to go somewhere for a bit. Just a little goodbye before I went back.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:03:12.327000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868644520521236521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"You could have said goodbye any other way... why?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:04:08.459000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868644755955937320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"She shrugs. \"I wanted to.\" Irynx laughs. \"Don't look too much into the things I do, Willow. Even I can't explain them.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:06:48.850000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868645428684537866","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"People are weird.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:07:20.233000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868645560314380329","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"That we are.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:07:33.480000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868645615876321320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"You are a great friend, Irynx.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:13:01.268000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868646990718857216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Much better than I deserve. Thank you for everything.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:13:44.703000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868647172898447370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Life's never about what anyone deserves. Bad people deserve horrible things. Good people deserve the best. No one gets any of that.\"\n\n\"You get what people give, and I want to give you good things.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T00:18:51.357000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-25T16:12:34.007000Z","id":"868648459098537985","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
